        {
          "name": "Radius",
          "type": "FReal"
        },
        {
          "name": "Always Return Closest",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TArray<FPBDRigidParticleHandle*>",
      "docs": "FindParticlesWithinRadius\nFind the closest particle from an array of  particle from a world position and a radius\ncurrent implementation will pick the closest based on the distance from the center\nfuture implementation may expose option for more precise queries\nif bAlwaysReturnClosest is checked this will always return  the closest from the location even if the radius does not encompass any center of mass\n@param Particles array of clustered particles to select from\n@param WorldLocation world space location to find the closest particle from\n@param bAlwaysReturnClosest if radius query does not return anything still return the closest from the point"
